Body:
I'm facing the  Tool-call parsing issue when trying to add Mistral's GLM 5.2 on Opencode v1.18.19.
Since the model isn't in models.dev's Mistral catalog yet, I manually configured it:

```json
{
  "model": "zai-glm-5-2",
  "provider": { "mistral": { "baseURL": "https://api.mistral.ai/v1" } }
}
```




Error: The model emits malformed tool calls:



```json
"function":{"name":"","arguments":" codebase structure"}
```




Which triggers:
```json
"tool_calls": [{
  "type": "function",
  "function": {"name": "", "arguments": "{}"}
  // Missing "id": "..." field
}]
```


Fix #25971 addresses GLM/NVIDIA tool calls, but Mistral's hosted version still fails. 

Workaround: "tools": [] disables tools, but loses functionality.

